  "status": "Appeal Received",
  "description": "Full planning application for the erection of five detached two-storey dwellings with basement level, associated access, parking, landscaping, and boundary treatment, following partial redevelopment of the residential curtilage at 43 Glanleam Road, Stanmore.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The proposed development would result in an\r\nunacceptable loss of trees, including those subject to Tree Preservation\r\nOrders, on site which have not been sufficiently assessed or justified.\r\nFurthermore, the proposed landscaping does not seek to provide an appropriate\r\nlevel of replacement for the tree loss. The proposal is therefore&amp;nbsp;contrary\r\nto the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies G1, G6 and G7 of the\r\nLondon Plan (2021) and Policies DM20, DM21 and DM22 of the Harrow Local Plan\r\n(2013).&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The proposed development would result in an\r\nunacceptable loss of Biodiversity on site which has not been sufficiently\r\njustified and fails to deliver acceptable biodiversity net gain. Furthermore,\r\nthe proposed landscaping does not seek to provide an ecologically sound\r\nwildlife corridor or appropriate green infrastructure across the site and\r\ntherefore does not deliver a benefit to local wildlife in this green belt\r\nlocation.&amp;nbsp;The proposal is therefore&amp;nbsp;contrary to the National Planning\r\nPolicy Framework (2024), Policies G1, G2, G6 and G7 of the London Plan (2021)\r\nand Policies DM20, DM21 and DM22 of the Harrow Local Plan (2013).&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The development\r\nproposal would result in inappropriate development within the Green\r\nBelt&amp;nbsp;and upon which substantial harm to the openness of the Green Belt\r\nwould occur. Furthermore, the development would not constitute Grey Belt\r\ndevelopment and no very special circumstances have been demonstrated by the\r\napplicant whereby the harm by reason of inappropriateness, other harm from the\r\nproposal and the substantial harm to the openness of the Green Belt is\r\noutweighed by other considerations. The proposal is therefore contrary to the\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy G2 of the London Plan (2021),\r\nPolicy CS1F of the Harrow Core Strategy and Policy DM16 of the Harrow\r\nDevelopment Management Policies Local Plan (2013).&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;In the absence\r\nof robust justification to demonstrate overriding wider public benefit, the\r\nproposed redevelopment of the site, by reason of built development encroachment\r\non a private rear garden, would constitute Garden Land Development and\r\nrepresent inappropriate development of the site, and would be at odds with the\r\nCouncils spatial strategy for growth to the detriment of the character and\r\nappearance of the locality, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework\r\n(2024), Core policies CS1.A and CS1.B of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012) and\r\nthe adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Garden Land Development (2013).&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
